# .github/CODEOWNERS — static ownership for hub files (Tier 1)
#
# Rules are LAST-MATCH-WINS: put broad rules first, specific overrides last.
# Place this file at .github/CODEOWNERS (GitHub checks .github/, then root,
# then docs/ — first found wins; keep only one).
#
# CODEOWNERS alone only *requests* reviewers. It BLOCKS a merge only when the
# branch protection / ruleset option "Require review from Code Owners" is on
# (see docs/agent/GITHUB_WORKFLOW.md). Owners must have write access or GitHub
# silently skips them.

# Default: the repo owner owns everything not listed below.
